  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SEEDNet fas 2 Moldavien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEEDNet phase 2 Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet (SEEDNet, South East European Development Network on Plant Genetic Resources,PGR, fas II (Jan 2008 - Dec 2010) syftar till att etablera och f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka nationella program f&#xf6;r beavarande och utnyttjande av v&#xe4;xtgenetiska resurser i flera l&#xe4;nder p&#xe5; v&#xe4;stra Balkan och Moldavien. Samordning och sekretariat sk&#xf6;ts av Centrum f&#xf6;r Biologisk m&#xe5;ngfald, CBM, vid SLU i Alnarp.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEEDNet, South East European Development Network on Plant Genetic Resources,PGR, phase II (Jan 2008 - Dec 2010) aims at establishment and strengthening of national programmes for PGR in several countries in Western Balkans and in Moldova. Coordinator and secretariat is with the Centre for Biodiversity, CBM, at the University for Agriculture, SLU, in Alnarp.</narrative>
  </description>
